{"seq":1,"slug":"gptq","title":"GPTQ 逐层量化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/llm-quantization-gptq-awq/techniques/gptq","wordCount":1395,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"gptq-逐层量化\">GPTQ 逐层量化</h1><p>朴素地把权重四舍五入到最近的 4 比特格点，会得到一个几乎不可用的模型——每个权重独立取整，误差互不补偿、层层累积。GPTQ 的关键洞察是：量化不该一个个权重孤立地做，而该「记账」——每量化一个权重并产生误差，就立刻调整尚未量化的权重去抵消它。这套源自上世纪剪枝理论的二阶误差补偿，让 GPTQ 成为第一个真正实用的 4 比特 LLM 量化算法。这一篇把它的数学讲清楚。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-逐层重建与误差补偿\">核心概念：逐层重建与误差补偿</h2><p>GPTQ 不试图一次量化整个模型，而是<strong>逐层</strong>地把问题拆小。对每一个线性层，它的目标不是「让量化后的权重接近原权重」，而是更聪明的「让量化后这一层的<strong>输出</strong>接近原输出」。给定校准输入 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>X</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">X</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span></span></span></span></span>，它最小化重建误差：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>arg</mi><mo>⁡</mo><munder><mrow><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>W</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></munder><mtext>  </mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">∥</mo><mi>W</mi><mi>X</mi><mo>−</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>W</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>X</mi><msubsup><mo stretchy=\"false\">∥</mo><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\arg\\min_{\\hat{W}} \\; \\lVert WX - \\hat{W}X \\rVert_2^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.6787em;vertical-align:-0.9287em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">ar<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6679em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.1713em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord accent mtight\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9468em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.7em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span><span style=\"top:-2.9523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop\">min</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9287em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">∥</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1968em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9468em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">∥</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这是关键的视角转换：我们不在乎单个权重偏了多少，只在乎它们合起来算出的激活偏了多少。一个权重的量化误差，完全可以被同层其它权重的微调抵消掉——只要最终输出对得上。这个层级的重建目标，正是 <a href=\"../methods/calibration\">校准</a> 里收集 Hessian 信息的用武之地。</p>\n<p>下表对比朴素取整与 GPTQ：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>朴素 RTN（四舍五入）</th>\n<th>GPTQ</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>量化单位</td>\n<td>每个权重独立</td>\n<td>逐列，带误差补偿</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>目标</td>\n<td>权重接近</td>\n<td>层输出接近</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>用到的信息</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>二阶 Hessian</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>4 比特质量</td>\n<td>差，常不可用</td>\n<td>接近无损</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"obs-血统-从最优脑外科到-gptq\">OBS 血统：从最优脑外科到 GPTQ</h2><p>GPTQ 的数学根子是 1990 年代的 <strong>Optimal Brain Surgeon（OBS，最优脑外科）</strong>。OBS 本是剪枝理论：要删掉一个权重，怎么同时调整其余权重把损失补回来？它的答案用到了损失对权重的二阶导数——Hessian 矩阵。</p>\n<p>GPTQ 把「删权重」换成「量化权重」，沿用同一套补偿数学。当我们把第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span></span> 个权重量化、产生误差时，OBS 给出对剩余权重的最优调整量。设 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>X</mi><msup><mi>X</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">⊤</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H = XX^\\top</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">⊤</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是这一层的 Hessian（输入的二阶统计），量化第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span></span> 个权重后，对其余未量化权重的补偿更新为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>δ</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>q</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mi>Q</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>q</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><msup><mi>H</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mrow><mi>q</mi><mi>q</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo>⋅</mo><msubsup><mi>H</mi><mrow><mo>:</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\delta = -\\frac{w_q - Q(w_q)}{[H^{-1}]_{qq}} \\cdot H^{-1}_{:,q}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3991em;vertical-align:-0.9721em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7401em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9721em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2472em;vertical-align:-0.3831em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:-0.0813em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mrel mtight\">:</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3831em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>直觉是：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><msup><mi>H</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mrow><mi>q</mi><mi>q</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[H^{-1}]_{qq}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1002em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 衡量第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span></span> 个权重「有多敏感」，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>H</mi><mrow><mo>:</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H^{-1}_{:,q}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1972em;vertical-align:-0.3831em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:-0.0813em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mrel mtight\">:</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3831em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 指明误差该怎么分摊到相关的其它权重上。每量化一个，就按这个公式把误差均摊补偿出去，于是误差不累积、被持续吸收。</p>\n<h2 id=\"让它在-llm-上跑得动-三个工程化改造\">让它在 LLM 上跑得动：三个工程化改造</h2><p>原始 OBS 对每个权重都要更新一次 Hessian 逆，复杂度对几十亿参数完全不可行。GPTQ 的贡献一半在理论、一半在让它真正能跑，靠三个工程化简化：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>固定量化顺序</strong>：原 OBS 每步挑「损失增量最小」的权重量化，要反复重排。GPTQ 发现对大模型，按固定的列顺序量化精度损失可忽略，省掉了昂贵的贪心选择。</li>\n<li><strong>惰性批量更新</strong>：不是每量化一列就更新整个权重矩阵，而是攒一批（如 128 列）一起更新，把内存带宽利用拉满，速度大幅提升。</li>\n<li><strong>Cholesky 分解求逆</strong>：直接对 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>H</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H^{-1}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 反复操作数值不稳定。GPTQ 用 Cholesky 分解预先算好需要的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>H</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H^{-1}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 信息，既稳定又高效。</li>\n</ul>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[逐层处理一个线性层] --&gt; B[用校准输入算 Hessian H=XXᵀ]&#10;  B --&gt; C[Cholesky 分解 H⁻¹]&#10;  C --&gt; D[按固定列顺序遍历权重]&#10;  D --&gt; E[量化当前列到 4 比特]&#10;  E --&gt; F[OBS 公式算补偿 δ]&#10;  F --&gt; G[把误差补偿到未量化的列]&#10;  G --&gt; H{攒满一批128列?}&#10;  H --&gt;|否| D&#10;  H --&gt;|是| I[惰性批量更新权重矩阵]&#10;  I --&gt; J{还有列?}&#10;  J --&gt;|是| D&#10;  J --&gt;|否| K[本层量化完成 输出4比特权重]\">flowchart TD\n  A[逐层处理一个线性层] --&gt; B[用校准输入算 Hessian H=XXᵀ]\n  B --&gt; C[Cholesky 分解 H⁻¹]\n  C --&gt; D[按固定列顺序遍历权重]\n  D --&gt; E[量化当前列到 4 比特]\n  E --&gt; F[OBS 公式算补偿 δ]\n  F --&gt; G[把误差补偿到未量化的列]\n  G --&gt; H{攒满一批128列?}\n  H --&gt;|否| D\n  H --&gt;|是| I[惰性批量更新权重矩阵]\n  I --&gt; J{还有列?}\n  J --&gt;|是| D\n  J --&gt;|否| K[本层量化完成 输出4比特权重]</pre><p>这三个改造合起来，让 GPTQ 能在单张 GPU 上几小时内量化一个 175B 模型。它产出的是 <a href=\"../foundations/quantization-spectrum\">量化谱系</a> 里定位的「仅权重 W4A16、per-group 128、PTQ」方案——权重 4 比特、激活仍 16 比特，配 128 的分组粒度。</p>\n<h2 id=\"gptq-的优势-代价与现状\">GPTQ 的优势、代价与现状</h2><p>GPTQ 的最大价值是：在 4 比特下逼近无损，且不需要任何重训。据 2026 年的多份评测，GPTQ 量化到 4 比特，多数任务的性能退化控制在可忽略到中等范围（常小于 4%）。一个 70B 模型经 GPTQ 4 比特量化后降到约 35-40GB，单卡可部署。</p>\n<p>它的代价主要在量化阶段：要算和存 Hessian、做 Cholesky 分解，量化过程比 AWQ 慢、显存占用高，且逐层重建对量化顺序和校准数据有一定敏感性。在推理侧，GPTQ 权重需要配合专门的反量化内核（如 ExLlama、Marlin），把 4 比特权重高效解包回 GPU 算力——这部分在 <a href=\"../practice/quantization-deployment\">部署与硬件</a> 展开。下一篇 <a href=\"awq-smoothquant\">AWQ 与 SmoothQuant</a> 会讲一种思路相反的方法：不补偿误差，而是预先让权重变得好量化，量化更快、对硬件也更友好。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>GPTQ 的核心是逐层<strong>误差补偿</strong>：目标是让量化后层输出接近原输出，每量化一个权重就调整其余权重抵消误差，误差不累积。</li>\n<li>数学血统是 OBS（最优脑外科），用 Hessian <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>X</mi><msup><mi>X</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">⊤</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H=XX^\\top</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">⊤</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的二阶信息算最优补偿；Hessian 正来自校准数据。</li>\n<li>三个工程化改造（固定顺序、惰性批量更新、Cholesky 分解）让它在单卡几小时内量化 175B 模型。</li>\n<li>产出 W4A16/group128/PTQ 方案，4 比特近无损，代价是量化阶段较慢、依赖专门推理内核。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>上游 <a href=\"../methods/calibration\">校准</a>：GPTQ 的 Hessian 从哪来、为何需要校准数据。</li>\n<li>同章 <a href=\"awq-smoothquant\">AWQ 与 SmoothQuant</a>：思路相反的激活感知缩放，量化更快。</li>\n<li>跨库：<a href=\"../../model-compression-inference/quantization/quantization-principle\">模型压缩 · 量化原理</a> 从压缩总览看 GPTQ 的定位。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"GPTQ 逐层量化","id":"gptq-逐层量化"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：逐层重建与误差补偿","id":"核心概念-逐层重建与误差补偿"},{"level":2,"text":"OBS 血统：从最优脑外科到 GPTQ","id":"obs-血统-从最优脑外科到-gptq"},{"level":2,"text":"让它在 LLM 上跑得动：三个工程化改造","id":"让它在-llm-上跑得动-三个工程化改造"},{"level":2,"text":"GPTQ 的优势、代价与现状","id":"gptq-的优势-代价与现状"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"校准","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/llm-quantization-gptq-awq/methods/calibration"},"next":{"title":"AWQ 与 SmoothQuant","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/llm-quantization-gptq-awq/techniques/awq-smoothquant"}}